### Create a new session
POST http://localhost:3000/session
Content-Type: application/json

###

@sessionId = 68d3fcdc99e4e7e653c37e48

### Get a specific session by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/session/{{sessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get all sessions
GET http://localhost:3000/sessions  
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new message for a session  
POST http://localhost:3000/{{sessionId}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "bbb",
  "role": "user"
